OL,3,ALarge Lake Ontario sign installed in
OL,4,ACanada in latest jab at US
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe war of words was triggered after
OL,7,Ftrade talks collapsed, with the US
OL,8,Fimposing new 50% tariffs on $20bn
OL,9,F(C$28bn) of Canadian goods. Canada will
OL,10,Fimplement "dollar for dollar"
OL,11,Fcounter-tariffs next month.
